{"event_type":"review","id":"0aed050c5841776fe1fcd9e3794ead2db4231567d11193409cc4277c087bea52","occurred_at":"2026-11-14T21:49:28Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/96105159181dd9ae736b84a3283e2fe4068631c9bb0d7b461b154c482aaeb17b","sha256":"96105159181dd9ae736b84a3283e2fe4068631c9bb0d7b461b154c482aaeb17b"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9bdc69cf3517c99004394ec0f27722e2f56a591cf9d13aa6a160facf674063be","sha256":"9bdc69cf3517c99004394ec0f27722e2f56a591cf9d13aa6a160facf674063be"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/2c302988ee36cfb7bf57d73dd601b84c409dca7b39c8c4ef50367ad3246f36a2","sha256":"2c302988ee36cfb7bf57d73dd601b84c409dca7b39c8c4ef50367ad3246f36a2"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9c600fb66f64852d79ff46354422fe7db68c7e3d0cb9f32a4a738edf7471cf71","sha256":"9c600fb66f64852d79ff46354422fe7db68c7e3d0cb9f32a4a738edf7471cf71"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/077c66dbfea17399c6dddea41556ba03d178bc2e470453bbeb4af473ec7c02df","sha256":"077c66dbfea17399c6dddea41556ba03d178bc2e470453bbeb4af473ec7c02df"}],"attempt_id":"33a3384b01878af4a749773c18f2e8a0afc0a7334c414f232be02d81b72570f2:0:1","base":"15ccd443253a74d0c8a37e3cca36dfeb78be3aec","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"502a34a13d58f5869843cda16331577bda8311af","body":"**Count assistant usage once per message ID.**\n\n`foldMessage` adds the usage of every assistant frame. Assistant frames that belong to one message can share the same ID and usage, and the SDK cost-tracking documentation says to deduplicate by ID to avoid double-counting. When no result usage is measured, the verdict falls back to this accumulated value, so the reported tokens and derived cost can double.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n       const usage = usageFromWire(inner['usage']);\n-      if (usage !== undefined) {\n+      const messageId = asString(inner['id']);\n+      const firstFrameForMessage = messageId === undefined || !observation.countedMessageIds.has(messageId);\n+      if (usage !== undefined && firstFrameForMessage) {\n+        if (messageId !== undefined) observation.countedMessageIds.add(messageId);\n         observation.assistantUsage = addUsage(observation.assistantUsage, usage);\n       }\n```\n\nAdd the tracking set to the run observation, then initialize it per run:\n\n```typescript\n// SdkRunObservation\ncountedMessageIds: Set<string>;\n\n// newObservation\ncountedMessageIds: new Set<string>(),\n```\n\n</details>","id":"698dbc5a1dc4ab5eaed931b9d81ee618bb0f2982e23ad6e37a364aca87708f32","intervals":[[1264,1264]],"path":"src/driver/claude-code/sdk.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Count assistant usage once per message ID."}],"head":"e7830f293d0a5e48f5035a31c31f45dd7edcc4ac","head_tree":"40cca612920bd0f60b7d7ded61025db433bf3a2a","input_scope":[{"blob":"502a34a13d58f5869843cda16331577bda8311af","intervals":[[1,1364]],"path":"src/driver/claude-code/sdk.ts"}],"job_id":"33a3384b01878af4a749773c18f2e8a0afc0a7334c414f232be02d81b72570f2:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"502a34a13d58f5869843cda16331577bda8311af","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/driver/claude-code/sdk.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"502a34a13d58f5869843cda16331577bda8311af","intervals":[[474,492],[503,515],[580,589],[654,668]],"path":"src/driver/claude-code/sdk.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"502a34a13d58f5869843cda16331577bda8311af","intervals":[[474,492],[503,515],[580,589],[654,668]],"path":"src/driver/c